          %h2#references References
          %h3#original_articles Original articles
          %p
            The original article suggesting the relation of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%3D11+supergravity"} D=11 supergravity
            to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+theory"} string theory
            (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M-theory"}> M-theory
            ):
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Edward+Witten"}> Edward Witten
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/String+Theory+Dynamics+In+Various+Dimensions"} String Theory Dynamics In Various Dimensions
              %strong 443
              (1995) 85-126 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9503124"}> arXiv:hep-th/9503124
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p An original article collecting all the weak/strong electric/magnetic dualities:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mike+Duff"}> Mike Duff
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em M-theory (the theory formerly known as strings)
              %strong 11
              (1996) 5623-5642 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9608117"}> arXiv:hep-th/9608117
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %h3#surveys_and_lecture_notes Surveys and lecture notes
          %ul
            %li#Schwarz97
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Schwarz"}> John Schwarz
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Lectures on Superstring and M Theory Dualities
                %strong 55B
                (1997) 1-32 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9607201"}> arXiv:hep-th/9607201
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/S0920-5632(97)00070-4"} doi:10.1016/S0920-5632(97)00070-4
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Dine"}> Michael Dine
                ,
                %em String Theory Dualities
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9609051"}> arXiv:hep-th/9609051
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bernard+de+Wit"}> Bernard de Wit
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jan+Louis"} Jan Louis
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Supersymmetry and Dualities in various dimensions
                %strong 520
                (1999) 33-101 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9801132"}> arXiv:hep-th/9801132
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://inspirehep.net/literature/453367"} inspire:453367
            %li#AlvarezGaume98
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Luis+Alvarez-Gaum%C3%A9"}> Luis Alvarez-Gaumé
                , Frederic Zamora:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Duality in Quantum Field Theory (and String Theory)
                %strong 423
                (1998) 46–83 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9709180"}> arXiv:hep-th/9709180
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.shpsb.2015.08.011"} doi:10.1016/j.shpsb.2015.08.011
            %li
              %p
                Stefan Forste,
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jan+Louis"} Jan Louis
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Duality in String Theory
                = succeed "A" do
                  %strong 61
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9612192"} arXiv:hep-th/9612192
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/S0920-5632(97)00516-1"} doi:10.1016/S0920-5632(97)00516-1
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ashoke+Sen"}> Ashoke Sen
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Duality symmetries in string theory
                %strong 77
                12 (1999) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://www.jstor.org/stable/24104472"}> jstor:24104472
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Duff"}> Michael Duff
                , chapter 6 of:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/The+World+in+Eleven+Dimensions"}> The World in Eleven Dimensions
                    \: Supgergravity, Supermembranes and M-theory
            %li#West12
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+West"}> Peter West
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Symmetries of String Theory
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Introduction+to+Strings+and+Branes"} Introduction to Strings and Branes
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1017/CBO9781139045926"} doi:10.1017/CBO9781139045926
            %li#Polchinski14
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Joseph+Polchinski"}> Joseph Polchinski
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Dualities of Fields and Strings
                %strong 59
                (C) (2017) 6-20 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1412.5704"}> arXiv:1412.5704
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.shpsb.2015.08.011"} doi:10.1016/j.shpsb.2015.08.011
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sebastian+De+Haro"}> Sebastian De Haro
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jeremy+Butterfield"} Jeremy Butterfield
              %p
                %em> The Philosophy and Physics of Duality
                , Cambridge University Press (2025) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.01616"}> arXiv:2508.01616
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://global.oup.com/academic/product/the-philosophy-and-physics-of-duality-9780198846338"} ISBN:9780198846338
          %p
            More on dualities induced on
            = succeed "-compactifications:" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/K3"} K3
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Aspinwall"}> Paul Aspinwall
              ,
              %em K3-surfaces and string duality
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9611137"}> arXiv:hep-th/9611137
              )
          %p
            More in view of the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/landscape+of+string+theory+vacua"} landscape of string theory vacua
          %ul
            %li#BrennanCartaVafa17
              T. Daniel Brennan, Federico Carta,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cumrun+Vafa"} Cumrun Vafa
              %em The String Landscape, the Swampland, and the Missing Corner
              (
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1711.00864"}> arXiv:1711.00864
              )
          %p Also
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cumrun+Vafa"}> Cumrun Vafa
              , around 3:30, 12:00 of
              %em On Mathematical Aspects of String Theory
              (
              %a{:href => "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yreUdrIbt2Q"}> video
              )
          %p
            Discussion amplifying the role of
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+theory"} category theory
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+geometry"} higher geometry
            is in
          %ul
            %li#Sharpe19
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eric+Sharpe"}> Eric Sharpe
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Categorical Equivalence and the Renormalization Group
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a{:href => "http://www.maths.dur.ac.uk/lms/109/index.html"} Higher Structures in M-Theory
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1903.02880"} arXiv:1903.02880
